{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01972",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 6.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.96,
      "end_seconds": 11.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.35,
      "end_seconds": 16.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.5,
      "end_seconds": 23.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 24.66,
      "end_seconds": 29.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "doctor, it's a swollen tummy. That's what we're worried about"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.9,
      "end_seconds": 34.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.13,
      "end_seconds": 40.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Two weeks, I think... sorry, one week, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.83,
      "end_seconds": 46.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.4,
      "end_seconds": 53.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Maybe a three out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.3,
      "end_seconds": 56.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.63,
      "end_seconds": 68.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Colicky tummy pain goes along with it, most of the time. The Colicky tummy pain? That's been since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.9,
      "end_seconds": 76.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Have you had a swollen tummy before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.02,
      "end_seconds": 89.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "a bit, a couple of years ago it settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.06,
      "end_seconds": 95.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "A A few quick ones: hernia, fever or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.95,
      "end_seconds": 99.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Uh, none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.93,
      "end_seconds": 103.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.73,
      "end_seconds": 107.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.37,
      "end_seconds": 112.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "so, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.17,
      "end_seconds": 114.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.7,
      "end_seconds": 119.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.1,
      "end_seconds": 129.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I look after my grandchildren most days. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.26,
      "end_seconds": 140.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.23,
      "end_seconds": 145.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "no, nothing as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.16,
      "end_seconds": 150.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.93,
      "end_seconds": 154.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 155.81,
      "end_seconds": 163.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "It's meant to be at night, though I don't see she take it every time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.42,
      "end_seconds": 169.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Right, has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.59,
      "end_seconds": 172.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.75,
      "end_seconds": 173.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.65,
      "end_seconds": 193.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.44,
      "end_seconds": 208.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.52,
      "end_seconds": 232.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, heart rate 121, blood pressure 134 over 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.47,
      "end_seconds": 235.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.12,
      "end_seconds": 240.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.14,
      "end_seconds": 245.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.63,
      "end_seconds": 250.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.53,
      "end_seconds": 273.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Your tummy is swollen and tympanic, with high-pitched tinkling bowel sounds."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.2,
      "end_seconds": 280.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.57,
      "end_seconds": 305.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards a bowel obstruction needing urgent surgical care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.21,
      "end_seconds": 310.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.2,
      "end_seconds": 329.82,
      "duration_seconds": 17.62,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a bowel obstruction needing urgent surgical care, and we'll know more once the urgent blood tests is back. I'd like to to arrange urgent blood tests for vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.54,
      "end_seconds": 332.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.13,
      "end_seconds": 357.97,
      "duration_seconds": 20.84,
      "text": "I'll request an abdominal X-ray, it'll help with possible obstruction. Nothing to eat or drink, and you are going to hospital now. Let's get you seen by the surgical team, I'll arrange the letter. We'll catch up straight away. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.58,
      "end_seconds": 360.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}